Hooks {#hooks}
==============

A <dfn lt="hook|hooks">hook</dfn> is a control point: the [=Observed Agent=] emits it before
or after a [=step=], waits for the Guardian's verdict, and applies it. ACS v0.1.0 defines 19
native `steps/*` hooks plus the wrapped `protocols/MCP/*` namespace, the Inspect-pillar
`agbom/*` methods, and the `system/ping` liveness method.

The per-hook payload schemas live under
[`specification/v0.1.0/hooks/`](https://github.com/afogel/ACS_official/blob/main/specification/v0.1.0/hooks/).
Common envelope rules — `request_id`, `timestamp`, `acs_version`, `metadata`, signature
handling, replay protection — are specified in [[#wire-envelope]] and
[[#replay-protection]].

Hook taxonomy {#hook-taxonomy}
------------------------------

<table class="data">
  <caption>Native hooks, wrapped namespaces, and system methods</caption>
  <thead>
    <tr><th>Hook<th>When it fires<th>Decision-eligible<th>Audit chain
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>[=hook/sessionStart=]<td>Session initiation, before any other `steps/*` hook for
        the `session_id`<td>Yes<td>Root entry
    <tr><td>[=hook/agentTrigger=]<td>Agent activation by event or schedule<td>Yes<td>Yes
    <tr><td>[=hook/turnStart=]<td>Beginning of an agent turn<td>Yes (most return
        ALLOW)<td>Yes
    <tr><td>[=hook/userMessage=]<td>User input received<td>Yes<td>Yes
    <tr><td>[=hook/agentResponse=]<td>Agent output before user delivery<td>Yes<td>Yes
    <tr><td>[=hook/knowledgeRetrieval=]<td>RAG or knowledge lookup<td>Yes<td>Yes
    <tr><td>[=hook/memoryContextRetrieval=]<td>Memory read<td>Yes<td>Yes
    <tr><td>[=hook/memoryStore=]<td>Memory write<td>Yes<td>Yes
    <tr><td>[=hook/toolCallRequest=]<td>Before tool execution<td>Yes<td>Yes
    <tr><td>[=hook/toolCallResult=]<td>After tool execution, before agent
        ingestion<td>Yes<td>Yes
    <tr><td>[=hook/preCompact=]<td>Before context-window compaction<td>Yes<td>Yes
    <tr><td>[=hook/postCompact=]<td>After compaction; carries the new summary<td>No (audit +
        lineage binding)<td>Yes
    <tr><td>[=hook/subagentStart=]<td>In-process subagent spawned<td>Yes<td>Yes
    <tr><td>[=hook/subagentStop=]<td>Subagent terminated<td>No<td>Yes
    <tr><td>[=hook/skillRegister=]<td>Skill enters the available set, before it can
        load<td>Yes<td>Yes
    <tr><td>[=hook/skillLoad=]<td>Registered skill activates into a session, before its
        actions run<td>Yes<td>Yes
    <tr><td>[=hook/skillUnload=]<td>Skill leaves the active set<td>No (audit)<td>Yes
    <tr><td>[=hook/turnEnd=]<td>End of an agent turn<td>No (audit)<td>Yes
    <tr><td>[=hook/sessionEnd=]<td>Session termination<td>No (audit finalization)<td>Yes
